{"ts": 0.139635, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.3\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.13968, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.143049, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mRedirection\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nA pipe sends output to \u001b[1manother program\u001b[0m. A redirect sends it\r\nto \u001b[1ma file\u001b[0m, and \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m replaces it without asking, whoever typed the line.\r\n\r\n", "len": 184}
{"ts": 0.143095, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m    write to a file (\u001b[91moverwrites\u001b[0m if it exists)\r\n  \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m   append to a file (creates if missing)\r\n  \u001b[92m<\u001b[0m    read a file \u001b[1minto\u001b[0m a command\r\n  \u001b[92mecho first > greeting.txt\u001b[0m        \u001b[90m# overwrite\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mecho second >> greeting.txt\u001b[0m      \u001b[90m# append\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcat greeting.txt\u001b[0m                 \u001b[90m# two lines\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mwc -w < poem.txt\u001b[0m                 \u001b[90m# count words read from poem.txt\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mls /usr/bin | sort > programs.txt\u001b[0m     \u001b[90m# a pipe and a redirect together\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mwc -l programs.txt\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Try them, then type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 634}
