{"ts": 0.171398, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93m4.4\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 255}
{"ts": 0.171445, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.174429, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mGlobs\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mGlobs\u001b[0m match many filenames at once. The shell expands them\r\n\u001b[1mbefore\u001b[0m the command sees them.\r\n\r\n  \u001b[92mls *.txt\u001b[0m              \u001b[90m# every .txt file in this folder\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 205}
{"ts": 0.174483, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "  \u001b[92mwc -l *.txt\u001b[0m           \u001b[90m# count lines in each .txt file\u001b[0m\r\n  \u001b[92mcat *.txt\u001b[0m             \u001b[90m# print them all back-to-back\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[91mPredict before you act.\u001b[0m  \u001b[92mrm *\u001b[0m removes everything\r\nin the current folder. \u001b[92mrm *.tmp\u001b[0m removes only .tmp files.\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mnext\u001b[93m to take Stage 4's gate.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 347}
{"ts": 0.177951, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mnext\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mprev\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 71}
{"ts": 0.178227, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 251}
