{"ts": 0.201611, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.201657, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.204692, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[1mRecall\u001b[0m (three questions, all three must be correct).\r\nFirst, three questions. Type your answer in words; this is not the shell.\r\n\r\nThen a \u001b[1mpractical task\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\n", "len": 204}
{"ts": 0.20689, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the question again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 91}
{"ts": 0.207146, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.210441, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 1 of 3   What does \u001b[92mcommand -v vim\u001b[0m print, if Vim is installed?\r\n", "len": 85}
{"ts": 0.21049, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "the path to vim\n", "len": 16}
{"ts": 0.210514, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m the path to vim\r\n", "len": 46}
{"ts": 0.220092, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.2235, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 2 of 3   What is the difference between \u001b[92m>\u001b[0m and \u001b[92m>>\u001b[0m?\r\n", "len": 82}
{"ts": 0.223561, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "> overwrites, >> appends\n", "len": 25}
{"ts": 0.223586, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m > overwrites, >> appends\r\n", "len": 55}
{"ts": 0.234485, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.238175, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m 3 of 3   Why does \u001b[92mvim my notes.txt\u001b[0m open two files instead of one?\r\n", "len": 89}
{"ts": 0.238242, "dir": "in", "enc": "utf8", "data": "because of the space\n", "len": 21}
{"ts": 0.238268, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[93m┃ ?\u001b[0m because of the space\r\n", "len": 51}
{"ts": 0.248441, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[93m┃\u001b[0m \u001b[92m[✓]\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 31}
{"ts": 0.26088, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J", "len": 11}
{"ts": 0.262225, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m──\u001b[0m \u001b[90mStage 4 · Commands and streams\u001b[0m \u001b[90m───────────────────────────────\u001b[0m \u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m\u001b[93m◉\u001b[0m\u001b[90m○\u001b[0m  \u001b[93mtask\u001b[0m \u001b[90m──\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 253}
{"ts": 0.262269, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n", "len": 2}
{"ts": 0.265453, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;97mSTAGE 4 — GATE TASK\u001b[0m\r\n\r\nWork inside /var/folders/jx/f_4n055973x5cwnyh_mhlw9h0000gn/T/shelltutor-sim-home-m2jzoyyt/stage4\u001b[0m.\r\n\r\nDo these:\r\n\r\n  1. Use \u001b[92mseq\u001b[0m and a pipe: count the lines of \u001b[92mseq 1 100\u001b[0m and\r\n     save that number to count.txt\u001b[0m.\r\n", "len": 272}
{"ts": 0.265535, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\r\n  2. Use a glob to list every *.txt\u001b[0m file in this folder.\r\n\r\nThen type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[0m.\r\n\u001b[90mI will check: count.txt exists and contains 100, and that you\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[90mlisted the .txt files with a glob.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n\u001b[93m▶ Type \u001b[92mcheck\u001b[93m when done.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 260}
{"ts": 0.268491, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[1;90mcheck\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(test your work)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mshow\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(the task again)\u001b[0m   \u001b[1;90mquit\u001b[0m \u001b[90m(save and leave)\u001b[0m\r\n", "len": 132}
{"ts": 0.268783, "dir": "out", "enc": "utf8", "data": "\u001b[90m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n", "len": 253}
